'''Laminats de Balboa, S.A.''' ({{lang|ca|Laminats de Balboa}}) is a Balboan aluminium rolled products manufacturer, producing aluminium sheet, plate, and foil from primary aluminium supplied by [[Alumini de Balboa]] and [[Metalls del Yalabirga]]. Founded in 1982 as a downstream component of the domestic processing chain, the company operates rolling mills at [[Badia Curta]] in [[Jala Province|Jala]], adjacent to the Badia Curta industrial complex. The company's foil products supply the processed food industry, while its sheet and plate products serve the construction sector and the BTPMEU market.

The company is listed on the [[Bolsa de Sant Cristòfor]] under the ticker LDB. [[Alumini de Balboa]] holds a 15 per cent stake, reflecting the vertical integration of the domestic processing chain from bauxite to finished rolled products.

